      "text": "Work performed",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Annual inspection per 14 CFR 91.409(a) and the scope and detail of 14 CFR Part 43 Appendix D, using the Cessna 172 inspection checklist."
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "ELT inspected per 14 CFR 91.207(d): installation, battery date, operation, and radiated signal."
    },
    {
      "id": "e8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Changed engine oil and filter. Compression check, cylinders 1 to 4: 72/80, 73/80, 77/80, 70/80."
    },
    {
      "id": "e9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Discrepancy: Elevator trim tab free play at the limit. Corrective action: Replaced trim tab actuator rod end bearings; free play within limits."
    },
    {
      "id": "e10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Discrepancy: Left cabin door seal torn. Corrective action: Replaced left cabin door seal."
    },
    {
      "id": "e11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Discrepancy: Spark plugs worn beyond limits. Corrective action: Replaced all eight spark plugs."
    },
    {
      "id": "e12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Aircraft found airworthy after correction of the discrepancies listed."
    },
    {
